  </div>
  <p class="claim rv">It started as a personal problem. <span>It became a lesson in building automation you can trust.</span></p>
  <div class="chips rv"><span>Python</span><span>SQLite</span><span>State machines</span><span>LaTeX</span><span>Playwright</span><span>Apify</span><span>pytest</span><span>GitHub Actions</span><span>gitleaks</span></div>
 </section>

